        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “ (c) after due inquiry by a Fitness to Practise Committee, which shall consist of not less than three medical practitioners appointed by the Council, been found to be unfit to perform his professional duties by reason of his mental or physical condition or any other medical condition,”. Amendment of section 20"
      }
