      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) An application for provisional registration as a medical practitioner shall be made to the Registrar in the specified form and manner and be accompanied by the documents and particulars and payment of a fee as may be determined by the Council.”. Amendment of section 13"
